title: Data Transfer to MTP Portable Device
id: 39967d49-799d-426e-8362-b30e1848b45a
status: experimental
description: Detects file transfers to a portable media transfer protocol device (phone or camera mounted via MTP under This PC), a physical exfiltration path that bypasses drive-letter based removable-media controls.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1052/001/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    CommandLine|contains:
      - 'MTP'
      - 'Portable Devices'
      - 'WPDBusEnum'
    CommandLine|contains:
      - 'copy'
      - 'Copy-Item'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - ParentImage
falsepositives:
  - Users syncing personal devices
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.exfiltration
  - attack.t1052.001
